{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/1-expansion.gif?t=1752225585\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/text-distinct.png?t=1752225585\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Asymmetric factions all with different playstyles \u2014 and more on the way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Surprise enemies with self-multipliers, piercer, knockbackers, cross-map movers, etc.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/3-factions.gif?t=1752225585\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/text-uncover.png?t=1752225585\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reinforce your dino army with found alien gears and captured buildings from other houses.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exploit strange terrain, treasures and tribes across the unique   biomes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/4-alien.gif?t=1752225585\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917910/extras/text-build.png?t=1752225585\" /></div></p><ul cla